{
  "_comment": "my-assistant CI/CD — ⛔ CSAK A RELAYT buildeli es deployolja. Owner (2026-09-07): 'A cicd csak ezt kell buildelje és deploy-olja.' A cli/ a szerver es a client SZANDEKOSAN kimarad: azok a RAVEN gepen, LDP alatt futnak (`current/principles/ldp-default-runtime.md`), es a my-assistant szerver kivulrol NEM elerheto. Egy 'buildeljuk be azt is, hatha kell' lepes itt nem semleges: a szerver deployja pont azt a hatart lepne at, amit az owner huzott.",
  "name": "My Assistant Relay CI/CD Pipeline",
  "outputDir": "./logs/cicd-pipeline",
  "timing": {
    "stepTimeout": "10m",
    "teeMaxRuntime": "10m",
    "stepCooldown": "1s"
  },
  "log": {
    "runtimeMaxBytes": 5242880,
    "trimCheckEveryN": 1000
  },
  "versionBump": {
    "enabled": true,
    "targetPackage": "../relay/package.json",
    "buildOverflow": 100000,
    "minorOverflow": 1000
  },
  "report": {
    "fileName": "cicd-report.json",
    "includeLogTail": true,
    "logTailLines": 10000,
    "includeStepLogs": true
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "label": "discord-start",
      "command": "dc ci-dn-s '{\"appName\":\"My Assistant Relay\",\"appEmoji\":\"📡\",\"commitMessage\":\"$COMMIT_MESSAGE\",\"branchName\":\"$GITHUB_REF_NAME\",\"author\":\"$GITHUB_ACTOR\",\"runNumber\":\"$GITHUB_RUN_NUMBER\",\"runId\":\"$GITHUB_RUN_ID\",\"repository\":\"$GITHUB_REPOSITORY\",\"eventName\":\"$GITHUB_EVENT_NAME\",\"eventDateTime\":\"$EVENT_DATETIME\"}'",
      "fatal": false,
      "discord": {
        "hide": true
      },
      "condition": {
        "envSet": [
          "DISCORD_WEBHOOK_ID"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "_comment": "A privat @futdevpro/* csomagokhoz (fsm-dynamo, nts-dynamo) NPM_TOKEN kell. ⭐ A token a CI-HOSZTON el — a Docker-kepbe SOHA nem kerul be, es .npmrc SEM keszul rola (`core-no-npmrc`).",
      "label": "pre-flight",
      "type": "pre-flight-check",
      "fatal": true,
      "discord": {
        "emoji": "🔐",
        "name": "Pre-flight Check",
        "group": "preflight",
        "groupName": "Pre-flight Check",
        "groupEmoji": "🔐"
      },
      "settings": {
        "requiredEnvVars": [
          "NPM_TOKEN"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "install-relay",
      "command": "cd relay && pnpm i --frozen-lockfile",
      "fatal": true,
      "discord": {
        "hide": true
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "relay-build",
      "command": "cd relay && npm run build-base",
      "fatal": true,
      "discord": {
        "emoji": "🏗️",
        "name": "Relay Build",
        "group": "relay-build-test",
        "groupName": "Relay Build and Test",
        "groupEmoji": "🏗️"
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "relay-test",
      "command": "cd relay && npx jasmine --config=spec/support/jasmine.json",
      "fatal": true,
      "discord": {
        "emoji": "🧪",
        "name": "Relay Tests",
        "group": "relay-build-test"
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "relay-lint",
      "command": "cd relay && npm run lint",
      "fatal": false,
      "discord": {
        "emoji": "🧹",
        "name": "Relay Lint",
        "group": "relay-build-test"
      }
    },
    {
      "_comment": "🔴 EZ A LEPES TESZI LEHETOVE, HOGY A DOCKERFILE NE TELEPITSEN. A `.npmrc` letrehozasa globalis HARD RULE szerint TILOS (`core-no-npmrc`) — egy build-stage-ben irt /root/.npmrc a tokent egy image-retegbe sutne. Ezert a privat csomagokat a CI-HOSZT szedi le (ahol a jogosultsag amugy is el), itt metszunk prod-ra, es a kepbe mar csak a KESZ node_modules kerul. ⚠️ A metszes a tesztek UTAN all: elotte a dev-fuggosegek (jasmine, typescript) meg kellenek.",
      "label": "prune-prod",
      "command": "cd relay && pnpm prune --prod",
      "fatal": true,
      "discord": {
        "hide": true
      },
      "condition": {
        "branchMatch": [
          "master",
          "release/*"
        ],
        "allPassed": [
          "relay-build",
          "relay-test"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "docker-login",
      "command": "echo $DOCKER_HUB_PASSWORD | docker login -u $DOCKER_HUB_USERNAME --password-stdin",
      "fatal": true,
      "discord": {
        "hide": true
      },
      "condition": {
        "branchMatch": [
          "master",
          "release/*"
        ],
        "envSet": [
          "DOCKER_HUB_USERNAME",
          "DOCKER_HUB_PASSWORD"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "_comment": "A build-context a `./relay` — a Dockerfile is ott lakik, es CSAK MASOL (Path B). Az image-nev egyezik a devops compose-eban levovel: futdevpro/my-assistant-relay.",
      "label": "docker-build",
      "type": "docker-build",
      "fatal": true,
      "discord": {
        "emoji": "🐳",
        "name": "Docker Build",
        "group": "deploy",
        "groupName": "Deploy",
        "groupEmoji": "🚀"
      },
      "condition": {
        "branchMatch": [
          "master",
          "release/*"
        ],
        "allPassed": [
          "relay-build",
          "relay-test",
          "prune-prod"
        ],
        "envSet": [
          "DOCKER_HUB_REGISTRY"
        ]
      },
      "settings": {
        "context": "./relay",
        "registry": "$DOCKER_HUB_REGISTRY",
        "imageName": "my-assistant-relay",
        "versionSource": "./relay/package.json",
        "tags": [
          "latest"
        ],
        "releaseTags": [
          "release"
        ],
        "skipIfPublished": true,
        "noCache": true
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "deploy",
      "command": "fdp deploy-service --services my-assistant-relay --webhook-url https://test-webhook.futdevpro.hu --webhook-secret $WEBHOOK_SECRET",
      "fatal": false,
      "discord": {
        "emoji": "🚀",
        "name": "Deploy",
        "group": "deploy"
      },
      "condition": {
        "branchMatch": [
          "master",
          "release/*"
        ],
        "allPassed": [
          "docker-build"
        ],
        "envSet": [
          "WEBHOOK_SECRET"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "pipeline-report",
      "command": "fdp pipeline-report --report ./logs/cicd-pipeline/cicd-report.json --server-dir ./relay --overseer-secret $OVERSEER_SECRET_KEY --branch $GITHUB_REF_NAME",
      "fatal": false,
      "always": true,
      "discord": {
        "emoji": "📊",
        "name": "Build Report"
      },
      "condition": {
        "envSet": [
          "OVERSEER_SECRET_KEY"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "_comment": "⚠️ A `--config` a `.dynamo/` alatti VALODI utat adja meg. Az organizer ugyanitt `./pipeline.cicd.config.json`-t ir, de ott a fajl szinten a `.dynamo/`-ban van — vagyis az az ut nem letezik. Mivel a lepes `fatal: false`, ez ott csendben degradal. Nem masoltam at a hibat.",
      "label": "discord-result",
      "command": "fdp pipeline-notify --report ./logs/cicd-pipeline/cicd-report.json --config ./.dynamo/pipeline.cicd.config.json --app-name \"My Assistant Relay\" --app-emoji 📡 --webhook-id $DISCORD_WEBHOOK_ID --webhook-token $DISCORD_WEBHOOK_TOKEN --server-dir ./relay",
      "fatal": false,
      "retryOnFail": 2,
      "retryDelaySec": 5,
      "always": true,
      "discord": {
        "hide": true
      },
      "condition": {
        "envSet": [
          "DISCORD_WEBHOOK_ID"
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
